{% endif %}{% if seam.head_floating %}Note: the top of image {{ seam.number * 2 }} is a figure, caption, footnote or table; the running text starts BELOW it — find the line that starts like the transcribed start below.
{% endif -%}
Transcribed end of page N (may have completed the last word): «{{ seam.tail }}»
